            <ArticleTitle>Cardiovascular and cerebral complications during glossopharyngeal nerve thermocoagulation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>433-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The cardiovascular and cerebral complications observed during percutaneous radiofrequency thermocoagulation of the glossopharyngeal nerve are described. The value of such symptoms in anticipating a lesion of the vagus nerve is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
